        {
          "name": "List products (next page)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/products?limit=20&after={{nextCursor}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "products"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "limit",
                  "value": "20"
                },
                {
                  "key": "after",
                  "value": "{{nextCursor}}"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "**What it does**\n\nGets the next page of **List products**, using the `next_cursor` that request saved in the `nextCursor` collection variable. It is skipped automatically when there is no next page (the user has 20 products or fewer).\n\n**Input**\n\n- Headers: `Authorization: Bearer {{token}}`\n- Query parameters:\n\n| Parameter | Type | Description |\n|---|---|---|\n| `limit` | integer | Products per page, from 1 to 100 (default 20). |\n| `after` | string | `{{nextCursor}}`: the `next_cursor` of the previous page. |\n\n**Output**\n\n| Status | When | Body |\n|---|---|---|\n| `200` | Always, for a valid token and parameters (an empty list if the user has no products). | `{\"data\": [...], \"next_cursor\": \"...\"}` |\n| `422` | Invalid `limit` or `after`. | `{\"error\": \"invalid_params\", \"details\": {\"limit\": \"must be an integer between 1 and 100\"}}` |\n| `401` | Missing, invalid or expired token. | `{\"error\": \"missing_token\"}` |\n\n| Field | Description |\n|---|---|\n| `data` | The products of this page: `id`, `name` and `created_at` (ISO 8601, UTC). |\n| `next_cursor` | Send it as `after` to get the next page. `null` when there are no more pages. |"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (!pm.collectionVariables.get('nextCursor')) {",
                  "  console.log('No next page: run List products with more than 20 products first.');",
                  "  pm.execution.skipRequest();",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
