        {
          "name": "AUTHORS",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/AUTHORS",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "AUTHORS"
              ]
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "description": "**What it does**\n\nReturns the static `AUTHORS` file, with the author's name. Public: no token needed. Clients and proxies may cache it for 24 hours.\n\n**Input**\n\n- Optional header `If-None-Match`: the `ETag` of a copy you already have. If the file didn't change, the response is an empty `304`.\n\n**Output**\n\n| Status | When | Body |\n|---|---|---|\n| `200` | Always, unless `If-None-Match` matches. | The file, as plain text. |\n| `304` | `If-None-Match` matches the current `ETag`: your copy is still valid. | Empty. |\n\nHeaders of the `200` response:\n\n| Header | Value |\n|---|---|\n| `Content-Type` | `text/plain; charset=utf-8` |\n| `Cache-Control` | `public, max-age=86400` (24 hours) |\n| `ETag` | A fingerprint of the content, for `If-None-Match`. |\n| `Last-Modified` | When the file last changed. |"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('returns 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('cacheable for 24 hours', () => pm.response.to.have.header('Cache-Control', 'public, max-age=86400'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/AUTHORS",
                  "host": [
                    "{{baseUrl}}"
                  ],
                  "path": [
                    "AUTHORS"
                  ]
                },
                "auth": {
                  "type": "noauth"
                }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "text/plain; charset=utf-8"
                },
                {
                  "key": "Cache-Control",
                  "value": "public, max-age=86400"
                },
                {
                  "key": "ETag",
                  "value": "\"0a8d59d8609ac72aea60d556503df6630c8d303e0d1f1aa4068dcc779c646022\""
                },
                {
                  "key": "Last-Modified",
                  "value": "Wed, 18 Nov 2026 16:21:47 GMT"
                }
              ],
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "text",
              "body": "Maribel Katherine Claros\n"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "description": "Endpoints that don't need a token."
